      "type": "object",
      "x-credential-instructions": "Copy your API key from Nanonets \u2192 API Keys. Paste the key alone. It grants full account access; NoClick sends it as the Basic username with an empty password. Connection verification reads your classification models without changing them.",
      "x-credential-url": "https://app.nanonets.com/#/keys"
    },
